## Direct workspace dependencies

| Crate | Depends on (workspace) |
| --- | --- |
| `skoro-backend` | none |
| `skoro-core` | backend |
| `skoro-operation` | backend, core |
| `skoro-dense` | backend, core |
| `skoro-riemann` | backend, core, operation |
| `skoro-graph` | backend, core, operation, riemann |
| `skoro-model` | backend, core, graph, operation, riemann |
| `skoro-linalg` | backend, core, graph, model, operation, riemann |
| `skoro-pointwise` | backend, core, graph, model, operation, riemann |
| `skoro-so3` | backend, core, graph, linalg, model, operation, riemann |
| `skoro-normal` | backend, core, graph, linalg, model, operation, pointwise, riemann |
| `skoro-se3` | backend, core, graph, linalg, model, operation, riemann, so3 |
| `skoro` | all of the above |

Generated from `cargo metadata --no-deps --format-version 1`. Keep `src/lib/crates.ts` in step.
